    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "30a Beach Properties presents the Providence Cottage in Rosemary Beach. Located south of 30a, this third-row covetable location has boardwalk H just steps from your front door. Access the beach without having to cross any roads with the little ones. A new renovation has just been completed in this wonderfully maintained cottage that has hosted many returning families. The three level floor plan allows families to have lots of elbow room. This custom-built home features shiplap wood walls, pecky cypress ceilings and rustic barn flooring. Newly renovated bathrooms and more providing a luxurious touch to your beach vacation!<br><br>We provide passes to access all 4 Rosemary Beach Community pools, and any of the 9 Beach Walkovers<br><br>All towels, bed linens, blankets, comforters, and pillow/mattress protectors are professionally laundered for every new reservation! <br><br>2 Kings<br>1 Queen<br>3 Twins<br>1 Full Bunk<br>1 Twin Bunk <br><br>This rare beach address is truly just steps to the Main Street cafes and Western Green. It's the perfect location to walk quickly down to the beach and back.<br><br>Pecky cypress ceilings, bright wood walls, and rustic barn flooring combine with all new modern clean bathrooms to make this home a memorable vacation rental spot. <br><br>The carriage house is an additional charge and is rented separately (vrbo #680098). This renovated showpiece sleeps 4 guests in a 2 BR/ 2 BA floorplan. <br><br>Providence Cottage features:<br>*1 Garage Parking Space, Fits Suv: Tahoe, X7, Expedition. Extended suvs will not fit. Passes for street parking additional cars provided.<br>* Kitchen designed to cook while entertaining <br>* Two full sized Subzero refrigerators <br>* Wolf 6 burner gas range & grill <br>* Bosch dishwasher <br>* 2nd floor covered porch with gulf view <br>* 3rd floor balcony with gulf view <br><br>1st floor: <br> Master BR with new bath & shower (KING)<br> Bedroom 2 with new full bathroom with bathtub combo (2 TWINS + 1 Trundle)<br>2nd floor: <br> Dining, kitchen, living, full bath, wet bar, 3 balconies <br>3rd floor: <br> Bedroom 3 - King bed and new full bath with shower <br> Bedroom 4 - Queen bed and new bath with shower. Gulf view balcony (QUEEN)<br> Bunk 1 - full bunk with TV & privacy curtain<br> Bunk 2 - twin bunk alcove with TV & door<br><br>* Wetbar with U-Line wine cooler & ice machine <br>* new washer/dryer on the first floor<br>* wireless internet<br>* flat panel TVs<br>* Weber outdoor gas grill<br><br>Three levels of living maximize the space for privacy as well as family get togethers. Fully equipped kitchen features a built-in Miele coffee machine, microwave, dishwasher, farm sink and wet bar copper sink. The Barbados pool (2 min) and Coquina Pool (4 min) are an easy and enjoyable walk away. Boardwalk H is truly outside the front door. Luxurious appointments, professionally cleaned and managed. We look forward to hosting you!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
